    "text": "13 WHAM\nwebsite\nRochester\nFourth of July activities in the Rochester area\nBy WHAM,\n1 days agoCommunities throughout the Rochester area will return with annual Fourth of July festivities this year, including races, family-friendly festivities, and of course, fireworks!. The Broad Street Bridge and Court Street Bridge will be closed to vehicular traffic for pedestrian viewing. Fireworks to launch at 10 p.m. Duration: 15-20 minutes. The...\n2",
